                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The shivver takes more than 20 damage from a single instance of damage</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The shivver is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of their next turn. They're then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Quickened] for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}, but while quickened their regeneration is deactivated, and they can use the extra action only to Strike.</p>"
                },
