                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A shivver can move through a gap at least 1 foot wide without @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Squeeze]{Squeezing} and can Squeeze through a gap at least 6 inches wide. Narrow confines are not difficult terrain for a shivver.</p>"
                },
