                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Ukara has an unnaturally distended, tooth-filled maw, granting her a maw Strike (an unarmed attack that has a reach of 10 feet and deals 3d8+12 piercing damage) and the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Grab] ability with that Strike.</p>"
